'''Ayumi Manbosaki''' (ハマンボ崎あゆみ, ''Ayumi Hamanbosaki'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Sunfish Jones]] that appears in the [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 3.5 Update|Version 3.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Ayumi Manbosaki
|image = E 152.png
|appearance = [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,333¢ - 13,165¢
}}

==Enemy==
Ayumi Manbosaki is similar to Sunfish Jones, but is much weaker, with about 1/5 the health, slightly lower range, less damage, and slower attack rate with the same animation. Even so, this enemy is not to be underestimated due to its singular knockback which allows it to easily finish its attack animation and deal extreme damage to your units. In the final stage of Manbosaki Strikes!, she has a gargantuan 6,480,000 health and 149,985 damage.

==Strategy==
Treat this enemy exactly like [[Sunfish Jones]], but with more immediately exploitable weaknesses.
First deal with the frontline, then use cats like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] to deal huge damage and finally kill her.

Alternatively you can snipe her using [[Long Distance]] cats or [[:Category:Waver-class Cats| Wavers]] so while you're dealing with the frontline you can keep damaging her at a safe distance.

