==Trivia==
*Her name is a portmanteau of [[wikipedia:Ayumi Hamasaki|Ayumi Hamasaki]], a Japanese singer, songwriter, record producer, actress, model, spokesperson and entrepreneur; and ''manbō'', meaning "sunfish".
**Her Japanese name, Ayumi Hamanbosaki, makes the reference even more apparent.
*During the first [[Survive! Mola Mola! Collaboration Event|Survive! Mola Mola!]] collab event, this enemy was simply known as "Peninsula Sunfish".

